535,0,4,9,2,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0],[459,65535,0,5,9,2,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0],[460,65535,1,0,11,0,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0],[461,65535,1,1,11,0,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0],[374,65535,65535,13,13,2,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0],[375,65535,65535,14,13,2,65535,65535,2,65535,0,0]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["HEXи瓁砞﹚"]},"end":26},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[0,12,19,0,0]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[1,13,19,0,0]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[2,1,2,1,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[3,1,3,1,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[4,1,4,1,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[5,14,19,0,0]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[6,0,22,0,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[7,0,23,0,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[8,1,22,0,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[9,1,23,0,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[10,0,21,0,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[11,19,7,3,1]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[12,0,0,0,0]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[13,0,0,0,0]},{"op":75,"name":"op_4b","args":[14,0,0,0,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1052],[]]},"end":34},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[584,0,0,13,0,26]},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[234,43,0,22,0,2]},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[190,45,0,20,0,15]},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[664,45,0,13,0,2]},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[368,0,0,0,0,16]},{"op":72,"name":"battle_equipment","args":[369,0,0,0,0,16]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[3,65535,65535,65535,48]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[77,0,17,17,3,0,1]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[78,0,17,17,4,0,1]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[75,0,17,21,3,0,1]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[76,0,17,21,4,0,1]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[79,0,17,13,11,0,1]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[80,0,17,14,11,0,1]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,401]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,24,1]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[2]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},"end":61},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[190,664,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[664,190,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n只要我们能守城超过十天，就可以给\n上大司马充足的时间回到扬州。\n&沈莹\n只是这次你也太大胆了，居然让陶璜来\n主持守城事宜。\n&张政\n陶璜虽然目前官位不高，但见识卓越，\n或许交州之败就是因为薛珝不肯用他的\n计谋吧。\n&沈莹\n该怎么说呢…我总觉得他不可靠，这人\n总是满口谎话，很少透露出心中的想法。\n&张政\n就算如此，他的计画绝对是可行的。\n&张政\n陶璜认为，如果让蜀人早早放弃江陵，\n就算上大司马成功回到扬州，面对数路\n兵马的夹击，胜算也很低。\n&张政\n陶璜要我们摆出少兵的姿态，让蜀人认为\n有机会可以报关羽丢城的仇恨。\n&张政\n之后再以伏兵夹击，挫败敌人之后坚守，\n这样就可以彻底拖住敌人的部队。\n&张政\n只要拖延半个月，上大司马和陛下应该\n就能解决掉来自淮南和徐州的部队。\n&沈莹\n听起来是有道理，但这样安排真的好吗？\n&张政\n怎么说？\n&沈莹\n就算陶璜和在下再怎么可靠，也不需要\n这样对待虞汜呀。\n&沈莹\n要他守在外城看守，这不是他擅长的\n工作。\n&张政\n那个虞汜虽然有过冒死劝谏孙綝的事迹，\n但打起仗来就畏畏缩缩，看了就让讨厌。\n&张政\n所以安排守外城城门，这样可以刺激他\n，逼这家伙勇敢点。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[190,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[664,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n（你们为什么都这么有恃无恐？难道你们\n不知道蜀人的可怕？在我看来，这坚固的\n城池简直像是装载我们的棺材一样。）\n&虞汜\n（该死的陆抗和张政，把我推到死地是\n什么意思？我的命不值钱？还是你吃定\n我们虞家世代对孙家忠心？）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[17,23,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[18,23,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,65535,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n仔细想想，我们似乎着了东吴的道。\n&张星彩\n看见江陵这地方，就算知道是座难攻不落\n的坚城，却还是想要打下来。\n&赵统\n沿路上，东吴贴的那些画实在太可恶了。\n&赵统\n什么擅取湘关米、白衣渡江、甚至还有\n关将军遇害，简直欺人太甚。\n&王浑\n我也认为东吴在刻意引诱我们攻击江陵，\n但就算有陷阱，我们不拿下此地，只怕\n追击部队后方还是会有所不安。\n&羊祜\n不如定个期限如何？数日内没攻下此城\n就撤退，这样至少还有机会在扬州和\n主力部队会合。\n&廖化\n不行！我一定要拿下这座城，好告慰\n关将军的在天之灵。\n&廖化\n那些吴狗欺人太甚，等破了江陵，一定要\n杀光画那些画的人。\n&张星彩\n总之先进攻吧，反正其他部队也会陆续\n抵达，战力上来说应该是足以拿下江陵。\n&羊祜\n（真的可以吗？这城不管从那个角度看\n都不好打，除非…能瓦解守将的心…）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[17,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[18,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[96]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑敌军全灭。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑我军全灭。\n二、回合数超过30。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑敌军全灭。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13288,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":13290,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,40,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,41,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,136,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,110,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,707,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,42,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13475,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[2,2]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[12]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,584,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,858,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,859,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,860,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,861,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,862,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,863,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,864,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,865,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陶璜\n现在就抱着玉碎的决心和敌人同归于尽！\n&江东骑1\n不会吧…\n&江东骑2\n我可不想死呀。\n&陶璜\n骗你们的，玉碎突击就算用了也无法改变\n战局。\n&陶璜\n只要趁机进攻，给他们一点压力就好了。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[584,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陶璜\n守城不能墨守成规，只有用进攻去逼迫\n敌人，才能完成完全得守备！\n&陶璜\n配合城内的守军，用骑兵撕裂敌人的\n阵型！\n&虞汜\n张政那家伙到底在想什么？为什么让一个\n地位低微的人来指挥全局？\n&虞汜\n浪费城内宝贵的兵力，真不知道他在\n想什么。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n被夹在中间还真是棘手，对付勇将还需要\n勇将，就让我来吧。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[18,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵统\n不，这次就让我来吧，我有信心可以\n打败眼前这个敌将。\n&张星彩\n好吧，一切交给赵将军了。"]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,11,21,14,23,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[12,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":14413,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[3,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[10]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,40,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,41,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,42,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,707,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,15,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,12,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,21,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&诸葛瞻\n西门果然守得密不透风，看来我们只能\n往南门攻了。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[40,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[12,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[15,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[21,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[41,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[707,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[42,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&黄崇\n据报荆州军已经在南门和敌人激烈交战中\n，我们应该即刻和他们会合。\n&诸葛瞻\n嗯…以优势兵力集中攻击敌人一点，才有\n可能攻破这座坚城。\n&黄崇\n（不，就算是这样，我还是很难保证能够\n顺利攻破此城，重点还是要有内应。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[42,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&诸葛尚\n阿照，等下我会掩护你，这次一定要让你\n成为攻克江陵的功臣。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[707,65535,0,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n为什么这样说？\n&诸葛尚\n你以为我不知道你心中的遗憾？糜家一门\n忠烈，都因为你叔祖糜芳的投降而蒙上\n阴影。\n&诸葛尚\n如果今天你无法帮大汉夺回江陵，你糜家\n的耻辱将永远无法洗雪。\n&糜照\n那么这次就拜托你了，做为回报，我会\n帮你把到那个姓甘的女将。\n&诸葛尚\n我不是说过不是你想的那样？\n&糜照\n哈哈哈，都几岁还这么害羞？"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[707,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n一切依照陶璜之作战…"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,350,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,351,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,352,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,353,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,460,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,461,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,0,9,1,11,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&宗预\n城内兵力如此薄弱，居然还分兵出城\n攻击，这守将还真大胆。\n&罗宪\n不，如果能够趁机给予攻击军重创，\n接下来攻城就会变持久战。\n&张翼\n眼下只有集中兵力，尽速突破眼前的敌人\n才有胜算了。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[10,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":15905,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[7,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[11]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,13,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,16,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,20,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,11,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,22,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&霍弋\n果然江陵城打得昏天黑地，看来我们到的\n还真是时候。\n&张嶷\n荆南四郡大致上都已经压制完成，只要再\n攻下江陵，荆州就差不多确定归大汉了。\n&关索\n江陵城呀…我就是在那里出生的…\n&花鬘\n（糟糕，气氛忽然变得有些哀伤，我该\n怎么安慰他？）\n&刘敏\n说到这江陵，就要提到一个好问题，江陵\n又叫荆州城，但荆州是荆州的一部份，\n丢了荆州不等于丢了全部荆州，而是…\n&关索\n绍先，快点攻城吧！\n&霍弋\n我有同感，与其听那家伙念经，我还宁可\n打仗。\n&张嶷\n别看刘敏这样，他真的很纤细体贴呢。\n&花鬘\n（刘敏他那么机灵？想想那个人似乎一直\n深藏不露。）"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[11,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":16560,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,13,4]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[21]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[91,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[21,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":16641,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":37,"name":"test_unit_at","args":[1025,14,4]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[22]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[96,65535,1,1025]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[22,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":16722,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[1025,3,0,5,8]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[23]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,3,0,5,1,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[23,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":16855,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[16,22,11,23,11]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[24]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n我看看…哇靠，这狗洞居然还在？！而且\n还越挖越大？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[574,574,"喂，大颗！林阿妈大白菜啦，一颗只\n要998啊！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n我懂了，哈哈哈…欧巴桑果然是最强的\n生物。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,16,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,16,0,22,9,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[24,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":17167,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[707,3,0,23,14]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[25]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n终于踏进这座城了。\n&糜照\n祖父您看好，糜家的耻辱就由我糜照来\n替您洗刷！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,2,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,3,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,4,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,707,0,0,0,0,0,6,5,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n只要能击斩守将，攻城的第一功就是\n我糜照的了。\n&糜照\n看我“英雄长弓将，风流万户侯”，\n今天要在江陵城显雄风！"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[25,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":9,"offset":17849,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":38,"name":"test_unit_in_area","args":[17,3,0,23,14]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[26]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&廖化\n终于回到江陵了，这次不会再把这座城\n让出去！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,2,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,3,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,4,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,17,0,0,0,0,0,6,5,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[26,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":10,"offset":18386,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[11,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[230]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&刘敏\n所谓的战败有分很多种，有谓先胜后败，\n也有先败后胜，也有胜败交错，也有不胜\n不败…（继续啰唆）"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,11,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[230,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":11,"offset":18584,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[18,584,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[46]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[18,584,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[584,18,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵统\n我乃赵云之子赵统，怕死的话就快快\n让开！\n&陶璜\n赵云？听都没听过，可以吃吗？\n&赵统\n你说什么？！\n&陶璜\n骗你的，常山赵子龙何人不知，我很尊敬\n他呢。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":52},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[18,584,24]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"承让，承让。",8]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"你这家伙怎么这么让人火\n大！�I",9]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,6]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"只要打败你，你想要火恐怕\n也火不起来，开玩笑的…\n",1]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"流星指刺！喔拉喔拉喔拉！",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,4,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,3,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[15]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,6]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"赵云之子果然厉害…\n骗你的，这样你是赢不\n了我的。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,6]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"这家伙还是这么让人火大！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"上段突刺！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,6]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哦？",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,12]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"你不是说上段突吗，怎么\n攻我下路？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"赵云之子就不能骗人？",1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陶璜\n哈哈哈…\n&陶璜\n武将的本愿就是战死沙场…骗你的，保命\n才是最重要。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,584,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵统\n对不起，明明曾经答应过爹不要说谎，\n但这家伙实在是太让人讨厌了。"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[99,0,1,18]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[46,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":12,"offset":19893,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[707,664,1]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[664,7,50,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[17]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[707,664,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[664,707,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n只要解决掉你，糜家的耻辱就可以\n洗刷了。\n&张政\n办得到就来吧。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["虫珼矪竚"]},"end":37},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[707,664,24]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"受死吧。",0]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"我张政不会轻言倒下！",0]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"看箭！",1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"……",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"什么！？\n怎么这么耐打？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哈哈！记住了！\n这是不死神功！",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"岂有此理！？",1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":102,"name":"duel_action3","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"什么！？怎么可能？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"我手中之神箭可破不死神功！",1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"不好，真的被穿透了！",1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"哇！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,11]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[38,1]},{"op":98,"name":"duel_62","args":[1]},{"op":95,"name":"duel_start","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n哈哈哈…难道这真的是上天安排？\n&张政\n四十多年前靠虞翻才获得这座城，现在他\n儿子却出卖这座城，真是讽刺呀！\n&张政\n虞汜！大吴如果因为你的背叛而有什么\n不测，我做鬼都会来找你！"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,664,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[707,1,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n好呀！祖父、爹，你们看到了吗？\n我帮糜家洗刷了耻辱。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[101,0,1,707]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[17,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":13,"offset":21012,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[23,16,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[42]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,16,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,23,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n关索，你没问题吧…\n&关索\n没关系啦，我虽然生在这里，但并没有\n在这里待几年。\n&关索\n或许老爹当年就感觉到东吴那边有问题，\n所以才会在事情发生前把我送到成都。\n&张星彩\n既然你知道这点，当年为什么还闹别扭？\n就算你在江陵，一个小鬼又能做什么？\n&关索\n知道是一回事，但做到又是一回事…\n&关索\n星彩，当日三叔遇害时，你不也哭得\n乱七八糟？\n&张星彩\n嗯…不管外貌再怎么不像，我们遗传自\n父亲重感情的个性还是不会变呀。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[42,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":14,"offset":21531,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[23,40,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[40]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[23,40,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[40,23,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n看你这样我就放心了，本来以为你经过\n西陵之败会一蹶不振。\n&诸葛瞻\n因为我知道自己要做什么了。就算是辅助\n角色，只要扮演好就是成功。\n&张星彩\n这几年你真的成长很多，看来你是越来\n越像丞相了。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[40,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":15,"offset":21838,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[707,234,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[41]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[707,234,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[234,707,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&糜照\n虞翻的儿子吗？真是久仰了。\n&虞汜\n你是谁？\n&糜照\n糜子仲（糜竺）的孙子，我得为你爹\n在东吴“照顾”我叔祖的事情道谢…\n&虞汜\n叔祖？对喔…糜芳的侄孙？\n&糜照\n是呀，忠臣虞翻可真勇敢呀，鞭打于禁，\n辱骂糜芳，怎么样都不会得罪人。\n&糜照\n我虽然也痛恨糜芳那家伙，但是糜家人\n受辱我也不可能装作没看见。\n&虞汜\n这…这…降将本来就该受人鄙视。\n&糜照\n你这家伙最好就不要投降我方。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[41,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":16,"offset":22318,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[16,234,1]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,1,2,1,21,0,23,9]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[163],[45]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[234,16,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[16,234,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n你…你是怎么进来的？\n&关索\n面对现实吧，你认为这座城可以撑多久？\n&虞汜\n想要劝降吗？门都没有。\n&关索\n我是分析给你听，想想城破之后你的下场\n，真是难以启齿。\n&虞汜\n你们难道敢屠城？别忘记这里有许多过去\n是你们的子民。\n&关索\n所以我们不会屠城，只会把复仇的怒火\n烧向你们东吴将领而已。\n&虞汜\n不会吧…\n&关索\n你说呢？想起过去白衣渡江的事情，我们\n大汉到现在都还有恨意。\n&虞汜\n可是，我是忠臣虞翻的儿子…\n&关索\n我也是关羽的儿子。可以向你保证，我\n不但不会让任何人伤害你，还可以让你\n成为攻下江陵第一功。\n&虞汜\n可是我还是…\n&关索\n你想想孙权对你多好，把你爹送到交州\n让你在那出生，那里可是个山明水秀的\n好地方呀。\n&关索\n那就是你爹忠诚所换来的。\n&虞汜\n……请记住你的诺言。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,234,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[79,1,16,13,11,1,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[80,1,16,14,11,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[77,1,16,17,3,1,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[78,1,16,17,4,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[75,1,16,21,3,1,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[76,1,16,21,4,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张星彩\n好呀，关索这家伙终于派上用场了。\n&张政\n虞汜？！怎么可能，忠义的虞家居然也会\n叛变？\n&沈莹\n士仁是刘备的旧部，糜芳更是忠臣之弟，\n他们不也投降我们大吴？\n&张政\n哈哈哈…失策呀…这下可完了…"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[664,190,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[190,664,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1052]]},"end":21},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n我打算留下来为失策负责，你赶快去通知\n上大司马，说江陵失陷，蜀人马上就要攻\n过来。\n&沈莹\n我明白，还请你多保重。\n&张政\n永别了…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,190,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1052],[]]},"end":37},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n我打算留下来为失策负责，你赶快去通知\n上大司马，说江陵失陷，蜀人马上就要攻\n过来。\n&沈莹\n说什么傻话，最起码也要陪你撑到城破\n的那一刻。\n&张政\n好吧，不过不要太勉强了…"]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,448,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,449,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,450,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,451,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,446,0,17,3,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,447,0,17,4,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,452,0,13,7,2]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,453,0,14,7,2]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,302,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,303,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,304,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,305,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[190,65535,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[664,65535,65535,0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张政\n来吧，就算是失败，也要败得有声有色，\n我要让你们看看大吴将领的骨气！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,664,0,0,0,0,0,6,0,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,664,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[1,65535,0,0,23,23,2,1,65535,0,0]},{"op":78,"name":"unit_op_4e","args":[0,664,0,0,23,23,2,2,65535,0,0]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[45,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":17,"offset":24678,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[584,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[52]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陶璜\n武将的本愿就是战死沙场…骗你的，保命\n才是最重要。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,584,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[52,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":18,"offset":24833,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[234,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[11]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,234,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,234,0,13,12,2]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":19,"offset":24948,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[234,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[163],[53]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n我不想死在这里呀…谁想要和江陵城\n共存亡呀…"]},{"op":83,"name":"unit_op_53","args":[0,234,0,0,0,0,6,1]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":14,"name":"ui_0e","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[53,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":20,"offset":25107,"title":"","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},{"op":54,"name":"test_attr","args":[234,7,0,2]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[11],[163]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n这仗怎么打得下去，双方实力差太多了。"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,234,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,234,0,22,5,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n出去也有危险，到最后还是躲在这里\n安全一点…"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1052],[]]},"end":8},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,446,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,447,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[110,110,"找到突破点了，那个虞汜有可能投降\n我方。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[42,42,"只要让他投降，江陵城就能马上落入\n我方手中。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[40,40,"问题是虞汜已经躲到城里了，要怎么样\n才能和他接触？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[23,23,"问问看待过江陵的人看看…"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[16,16,"我！我！我！"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[23,23,"我怎么好像听见有只公鸡在叫唤？\n算了，不管它。廖将军有办法吗？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[17,17,"我也不知道用什么方法可以钻进江陵。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[16,16,"星彩，我有个办法！"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[16,16,"嘿嘿嘿，当我还是小屁孩的时候，经常从\n外城的水沟钻狗洞进城。"]},{"op":91,"name":"op_5b","args":[22,11,23,11,0]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[23,23,"那么就请你钻狗洞，想办法去说服虞汜\n吧。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[71],[]]},"end":22},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,16,0,13,16,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n问题是，我真的能够钻得了吗？都过这么\n多年，这洞还在吗？"]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑敌军全灭。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑我军全灭。\n二、关索撤退。\n三、虞汜死亡。\n四、回合数超过30。"]}